{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40722","headline":"宿叶公棋阁 · 李洞","name":"宿叶公棋阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"带风棊阁竹相敲，局莹无尘拂树梢。\n日到长天征未断，钟来岳顶劫须抛。\n挑灯雪客栖寒店，供茗溪僧爇废巢。\n因悟修身试贪教，不须焚火向三茅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40722.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40722","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}